{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>Because you have done this thing</b> — Even from the beginning (Genesis 13:16, 15:5) He had promised him that He would multiply his seed like the stars of the heavens and like the dust of the earth, but now He added to him, “because you have done this great deed,” that He swore by His great Name, and that his seed would possess the gate of his enemies. Behold, he was promised that no sin would cause his seed to be annihilated, or that they would fall into the hand of their enemies and not rise again. And behold, this is a complete promise regarding the future redemption for us."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:33:11.062394809Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}